{title: A Christmas Hallelujah}
{artist: Cassandra Star}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[F]I've heard about [Dm]this baby boy,        Who's [F]come to earth to [Dm]bring us joy
And [A#]I just want to [C]sing this song to [F] ..U... [C]
It [F]goes like this, the [A#]fourth, the [C]fifth
The [Dm]minor fall, the [A#]major lift
With [C]every breath I'm [A]singing Halle [Dm]lujah
Halle [A#]lujah, Halle [Dm]lujah,        Halle [A#]lujah, Halle [F]lu-u- [C]u-u- [F]jah
