To [A#]find a place for,        [C]You were coming [F]soon... [C]
There [F]was no room for [A#]them to [C]stay,        So [Dm]in a manger [A#]filled with hay
God's [C]only Son was [A]born, oh Halle [Dm]lujah
Halle [A#]lujah, Halle [Dm]lujah,        Halle [A#]lujah, Halle [F]lu-u- [C]u-u- [F]jah
